# Vulnerability details


## Impact

The potential integer underflow/overflow vulnerability in the code can lead to incorrect calculations, unexpected behavior, and potential security issues.


## Proof of Concept

In the provided code, there are a few areas where potential integer underflow/overflow vulnerabilities could be present:


In the **attach** function: [LINK](https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-05-maia/blob/main/src/erc-20/ERC20Boost.sol#L116-L135)


    uint128 userGaugeBoost = balanceOf[user].toUint128();

