## Impact
By illegally setting `isBridgeAgentFactory` mapping for a particular address(EOA or contract) to true, the following can happen:

- the address will be able to call `RootPort#addBridgeAgent`, passing in any account(EOA or contract) he wishes, which would allow that account to call `RootPort#burn` or `RootPort#bridgeToRoot` to burn or mint any amount of hTokens he wishes.

